magic
tech OR1
<< metal1 >>
rect 0 56 1 60
rect 0 -1 1 2
<< labels >>
rlabel metal1 s 0 56 1 60 1 VDD
port 1 nsew power input
rlabel metal1 s 0 -1 1 2 1 VSS
port 2 nsew ground input
<< properties >>
string FIXED_BBOX 0 0 1 60
string LEFclass CORE
string LEFsite unit
string LEFsymmetry X Y
string LEFview TRUE
<< end >>
